                "type": "boolean"
              },
              "level": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "line_spacing": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "note": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "occurrence": {
                "description": "Which match of find, from 1.",
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "op": {
                "description": "Fields (* required, | one of, range: find, occurrence, start, end): replace (ref*, with*, range): Replaces a text range. insert (ref*, place*, paragraphs*): Inserts new paragraphs before or after a paragraph or a table. delete (ref*, to, range): Deletes a whole paragraph or table. split (ref*, at|before|after): Cuts a paragraph in two. merge (ref*, second): Joins a paragraph and the one after it. format (ref*, bold, italic, underline, strike, color, highlight, size, font, char_style, clear, range): Changes the formatting of the runs in a range. paragraph (ref*, align, indent_left, indent_right, first_line, hanging, space_before, space_after, line_spacing, keep_next, keep_lines, page_break_before, clear): Changes the formatting of a paragraph. style (ref*, style*): Sets the paragraph style. list (ref*, level|restart|remove): Changes the level of a list item. set (props*, target, ref, section, cell, clear, range): Sets any schema property of a paragraph. row (ref*, action*, place, cells): Inserts a table row. comment (ref*, text*, initials, range): Adds a comment anchored to a range. reply (comment*, text*): Replies to a comment thread. resolve (comment*, reopen): Resolves a comment thread. edit-comment (comment*, text*): Replaces the text of one of the author's own comments. delete-comment (comment*): Deletes one of the author's own comments. delete-note (note*): Deletes a footnote or endnote. accept (all|author|ids): Accepts revisions. reject (all|author|ids): Rejects revisions.",
                "enum": [
                  "replace",
                  "insert",
                  "delete",
                  "split",
                  "merge",
                  "format",
                  "paragraph",
                  "style",
                  "list",
                  "set",
                  "row",
                  "comment",
                  "reply",
                  "resolve",
                  "edit-comment",
                  "delete-comment",
                  "delete-note",
